        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.086,
            0.882,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": "**(b) 997 can be made using 25 clicks. Can you make 997 with a different number of clicks?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.139,
            0.485,
            0.157
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** 997 can also be made as –"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.242,
            0.195,
            0.534,
            0.237
          ],
          "content": "Number of clicks = 8 + 19 + 7 = 34"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.249,
            0.881,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": "？ **How can we get the numbers (a) 5072, (b) 8300, using as few button clicks as possible?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.298,
            0.201,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.325,
            0.568,
            0.374
          ],
          "content": "**(a) 5072 = (5** × **1000) + (7** × **10) + (2** × **1)** Number of clicks = 14"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.45,
            0.282,
            0.47
          ],
          "content": "？ **Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.48,
            0.882,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": "**1. For the numbers in the previous exercise, find out how to get each number by making the smallest number of button clicks and write the expression.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.557,
            0.23,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.641,
            0.692,
            0.69
          ],
          "content": "**(b) 40629** = (4 × 10000) + (6 × 100) + (2 × 10) + (9 × 1) Number of clicks = 4 + 6 + 2 + 9 = 21"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.698,
            0.808,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": "**(c) 56354** = (5 × 10000) + (6 × 1000) + (3 × 100) + (5 × 10) + (4 × 1) Number of clicks = 5 + 6 + 3 + 5 + 4 = 23"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.755,
            0.811,
            0.804
          ],
          "content": "**(d) 66666** = (6 × 10000) + (6 × 1000) + (6 × 100) + (6 × 10) + (6 × 1) Number of clicks = 6 + 6 + 6 + 6 + 6 = 30"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.814,
            0.3,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "(f) **367813** ="
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.841,
            0.866,
            0.89
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{aligned} &\\left(3 \\times 100000\\right) \\div \\left(6 \\times 10000\\right) \\div \\left(7 \\times 1000\\right) \\div \\left(8 \\times 100\\right) \\div \\left(1 \\times 10\\right) \\div \\left(3 \\times 1\\right)\\\\ &\\quad  Number of clicks  = 3 \\div 6 \\div 7 \\div 8 \\div 1 \\div 3 = 28\\\\ \\end{aligned}",
